# Root documentation is not needed by any build and has carried a secret.
*.md

# Root non-runtime files, named explicitly rather than relying on the `*.md`
# glob above. PROJECT_STATE.md carried a real provider key and must never be able
# to reach a build context again. `.env` is already excluded above; `.env.example`
# and infra/env.prod.example stay included on purpose (they hold placeholders only).
